# Backend

## Imports

- May import: `@preflight/rules`, `@preflight/schemas`, Prisma, GitAgent, self.
- Never import: `preflight-web`, `@preflight/rules` from `agents/*`.
- Cross-package: `@preflight/*` names, never `../../packages/...`.

## Envelope

Every HTTP response: `ApiResponse<T>` from `@preflight/schemas`.

- Success: `{ success: true, data }`. `data` never `null` — use `[]` or `{}`.
- Error: `{ success: false, error: string }`.
- Never HTTP 200 with `success: false`.

Routes return DTOs from services; services throw typed errors; routes map to status + envelope.

## Structure

- Routes call controllers/services only — no Prisma in routes.
- All DB in `*.service.ts`. One Prisma client in `src/lib/prisma.ts`.
- Env via `import { env } from '@/config/env'` — never `process.env` elsewhere.
- `foldStatus` on every read — never write status to DB.

## LLM (GitAgent)

- One `query()` shot → Zod parse → fail closed. No JSON-repair retry.
- Empty tool list. No memory / RL / git-write.
- Models never emit compile `ruleIds` or trusted offsets. Server interpolates snapshot wording into prompts.
- Parse fail: no asset row (generate/extract) or finding `unavailable` (judge).
- Fan-out: one call per judgement rule; `Promise.allSettled`.

## Done

- `check-types` passes on touched packages.
- If rules/schemas changed: Vitest passes there.
- Brief adapter (Zod → `StructuredBrief`) has a test when touched.
